        <p>Dr. Williams' Pink Pills are safe and beerficial to the most delicate constitution. They give strength and new blood. The price is 2e. 9J. per box, six boxes 13s. 9d., stoat free, from Dr. Williama' Medicine Coospany, Bolhorne-viaduct, London, and any question as to title uitability to any nmolaint named, or illaeis described, will he cheerfully answered by post. The pills can also be obtained wherever medicine is sold, but to avoid dmigerOui substitutes (which may Ise purgative, end sigma very dangerous to a Weak Heart) it it necessary on having, AV/ le Insist /49( DR the genu- ,p IN ice pills 1\ with "Dr t Williams' . Pink Pills 'il _ k for Pale , 'EC)? People" on the wrapper. Tnese piils have cored paralysis, loco- motor ataxy, rheumatism, and sciatica; also all diseases arising from impoverishment of the blood, scrofula, rickets, chronic erysipelas, consumption of the bowels and lungs, acvemia, pale and sallow complexion, weak- sees, lies of appetite, palpitations, pains is the batik, nervous headache, neuralgia, and hysteria.</p>
        <p>The clergy of the Manchester diocese have forwarded a protest to Parliament regarding the alterations effected in the Education Bill during its progress through the House of Commons. The opinion is expressed that it the Bill is passed in is altered form it must be fatal to the denominational system of education which it pro- poses to safeguard. The French police are trying to trace four occupants of an autocar who a few days ago deserted a baby on toe rcadside between Churbourg and Paris. Money and a letter were left with the infant, is "the issue of ono of the noblest families in England."</p>
