        <head>vo rE OF TEIANIK S.</head>
        <p>vo rE OF TEIANIK S.</p>
        <p>MrS ZIBI ARMITAGE maid they wool I not separate without thanking Mr Crosfield for presiding,tliss Robin- son for her excellent addrese, and the artisteS for the pleasure the p had given. (Applause.) The vote W4FI unanimously *red to and a pleasant gathr ring concluded. •</p>
